    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d228ae4ac1f529fe7315126",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我总算是窥见她身份真相的一角。\r\n新宇宙也是特雷森学园的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f095a5bd94fb1c555f383b2a31eae1077662362d529a072392e7c8b9102e87c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
