    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe24b18086a5233c44641d16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果不把这两个问题弄清楚的话，我也没法帮上她的忙。\r\n即便是无法理解她究竟是怎样的存在……\r\n也至少要知晓她的目的才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cf5f3916be589f08f3405891919e7db4440eacf5501a9e13d90839d65bc7637",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
