      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看见这副模样，我终于接受了这个现实。\r\n果然，新宇宙也只是一个普普通通的特雷森学园学生……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3675bfdcdc46d14a5c6ef22333396e697b90b999d0d3a48fff7a7d6a9f152a31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
