      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04f39cd4139ca189559f33be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，完全不普通。\r\n这还是无法解释她奇怪的言行举止。\r\n她……究竟是怎样的赛马娘？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0ce21209dcc5a8c41640c705bac12350bd386ab7a28b1c64964b433a25af373",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
