    {
      "uid": "zhcn:704f072228535415f60ebcb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让人觉得有些奇妙的赛马娘……\r\n因为他人很难理解她的话语，\r\n所以她在班里也几乎都是孤身一人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfac7a1b82db9b7df60e16a1f46771b8fe7c4b9587a74c7bfc70e2e4a4477c2c",
