      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过……我倒是时不时能与她聊上几句哦。\r\n毕竟我是图书委员，\r\n而尤妮同学又经常造访图书馆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89d72eadc8e3d441ee2fb947ade6c65f344bb9af2cc73411c762357e78274b69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
