    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7bb401f1bda15fb3727cb43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尤妮同学……那个……\r\n我虽然已经和尤妮同学聊过许多事情了……\r\n但今天我还是第一次看见尤妮同学奔跑时的身姿！该怎么说才好呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfb439ce40f7c4d67ac7d73833575b53efef88e575118863d573e9c33632cfa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf32098f53cde39c0bad3ec9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b43800fd313ceed9e0d9964",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实在是……非常完美的表现！\r\n与我所憧憬的英雄一般的奔跑不同，\r\n尤妮同学奔跑时展现出了可谓是高次元观测一般的判断力呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "036b4f5bff292481d5c04d1ddbe7cade5e92e6fda3358e3e9e8d10d44eabd733",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04d7204d778dbcea755cb9f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe7e4c24d9e7f5d4a74e124d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别是最终直线上的冲刺！实在是令人惊叹！\r\n毫不犹豫地从两人间的缝隙越出人群……\r\n有那么一瞬间，我还以为你消失了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d361f8afbe84d9fa99ce5ca7e410fb59fd9a9f1df7df6518640030dbaabb64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df24aaa78530206c47cf3f02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
