      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc15d9e7ae4573c2f611a2b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想……做什么……\r\n新宇宙——想要“升华”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd6c0989a99791d9b23fd4164ce70456f5975a1cad85b1966c93287ac47af8e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95d9ee8e080e6ecbdc1415f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“以为你消失了”。\r\n也就是说……\r\n实际上并没有真的消失，对吧。既然这样的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ac8ec4a1021201e058e7baf8517579bc8e018c26609d8306cc0ea9c42cf6c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6526309113ed951fc5f313dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙的所谓“真实身份”……\r\n就只是个性格有些古怪的赛马娘而已。\r\n也许从一开始就是我想太多了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b180c03d36ccca9964a23cfb4a5c03ac26b653436008d83fe22453b593989cc8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f49ec02dc39e820d8a8d463",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
