    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c522b77a89b9282f72d63ee9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……………………",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c78ee78022216ef14f7596b5295ce49c7ef6ef5511f3d2f9cd257679c49c9d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb680facb7a7a203189edbc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不过，还是有些事情令我非常在意。\r\n新宇宙的的确确地在渴求着什么……\r\n而我仍然无法理解她的目的。况且——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d955b2b95af8a421ed952f4864ffb5d28cd98c40d107431c31962f39085e9f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d2b75e5cf51ef174150e2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那一日——她的确身处上了锁的天台。\r\n如果不是从天而降的话，\r\n她是怎样进入那被上了锁的天台的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "70a7abf422167a6899b72c6ea85bd6e0072f07fa71b1ec8341ef0cca229b8ce2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105003.json",
      "json_path": [
